{
  "id": "modules/units/08_indexed_by_its_build",
  "topic": "modules",
  "subtopic": "units",
  "title": "A module unit compiled once",
  "summary": "A module unit is compiled once, into the module file its importers read, and that compile indexes it too",
  "prose": "The build of the module file merges the unit's index into the project's, which the background index then finds current, and a file importing the module completes the names the module exports from the module file its compile loads.",
  "status": "supported",
